---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import Nav from '../components/nav.astro'
import Footer from '../components/footer.astro'
---
<Layout title="About · Bao">
  <Nav />
  <main id="main">
    <div class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">The person behind the projects</p><h1>A little about <span>me.</span></h1><p>19 years old. Based in New Zealand. Always learning something new.</p></div>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <section class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">Hello there</p><h2>I'm Bao.</h2><p>Also known as Stellovate online, I'm a self-taught developer learning to build apps. I'm especially interested in game development and web development.</p><p>I like taking an idea and figuring out how to make it work, whether that's a game system or something for the web.</p></section>
      <section class="panel game-panel"><p class="eyebrow">Where it started</p><h2>Making games.</h2><p>I've been learning game development for about four years, working with engines like Roblox Studio. I've made small games and contributed to bigger projects along the way.</p><a href="/#projects">Take a look at my projects <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a></section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
<style>
  h1 span { color: var(--color-puh); }.about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-top: 40px; }
  h2 { margin: 16px 0 20px; } .panel > p:not(.eyebrow) { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; margin-top: 16px; }
  .game-panel { background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--color-glass), transparent), var(--secondary-bg); }.game-panel a { display: inline-block; margin-top: 24px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-puh); }
  .note { margin-top: 32px; font-size: 12px; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
